{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "9a5045a2-a479-88a0-9bb9-097fc5f4f0f3",
  "created_at": "2026-02-03T10:00:33-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anabela Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:58:13-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, good morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:58:16-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning. I am calling about a streetlight pole. A car hit it, and now the pole is leaning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:58:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, okay. When did this happen, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:58:27-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I think Sunday night. I saw it Monday morning. Pole is leaning to the side, maybe fifteen degrees. Light is still on, but I am worried it can fall."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:58:38-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. Where is the pole? Give me the street and the nearest cross street or number."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:58:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, I do not want to give address on this call. Can I tell you the pole is on a residential street, near a corner?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:58:53-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hmm, I really do need a location for a crew to find it. Do you have a cross street, or a landmark close by?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:59:02-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] I can call back with location. Right now I am only asking, please, to send crew to check the pole. Is that possible?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:59:11-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can put in a request for a crew to look at it, but it can't go out until I have where it is. Do you want to leave a number so I can call you for the location, or will you call back?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:59:27-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can call me. Number is four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-zero."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:59:31-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, zero-one-six-zero. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:59:34-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anabela Varela. A-N-A-B-E-L-A. Varela, V-A-R-E-L-A."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:59:37-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Was anyone hurt, or is there any wire hanging down?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:59:42-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, nobody hurt. I do not see wires. Car is gone already. Only pole is bent."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:59:48-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Is there anything else I can add for the crew? Is it close to the road or a sidewalk?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T09:59:56-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Close to sidewalk. People walk there, children too. Also, I do not have internet at home, so I cannot use the website. I use computers at the public library. If there is a form, I can do it there."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:00:10-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. You can report it on the city website from the library computers, with the location right on it. But I'll also note it here, and I'll try you at this number this afternoon for the location."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:00:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I will be near phone. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:00:28-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Varela. Talk to you soon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T10:00:32-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Goodbye."
    }
  ],
